  "instructions": [
    "Cut the fermented tofu into small cubes and set aside",
    "Cook the rice noodles according to package instructions and drain",
    "In a large pan, heat the vegetable oil over medium heat",
    "Add the tofu cubes to the pan and cook until crispy and golden brown",
    "In a small bowl, mix together the soy sauce and sesame oil",
    "Pour the soy sauce mixture over the tofu and noodles",
    "Stir in the coconut cream and vegan cheddar cheese until well combined",
    "Top with chopped scallions and serve immediately"
